scenario redefine over surf04
  tally 2
  from 2025-01-01
  note "contrib stated a second time: one namespace holds every top-level id of a reality (L 2.5), so this file is refused at load (LOAD-DUP) before anything runs; a load refusal in a scenario file refuses only that scenario (L 8.3)."

def contrib[m in months]: money DUK = round(contrib_rate * gross[m], minor(DUK), half-up) at start_of(m)
